<title>USA: Harvey to buy back up to 380,000 shares.</title>
<headline>Harvey to buy back up to 380,000 shares.</headline>
<dateline>LOS ANGELES 1997-01-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Harvey Entertainment Co said Monday its board had authorized a stock repurchase program to buy back up to 380,000 shares, or about 10 percent of the outstanding shares of its common stock.</p>
<p>Harvey said that as of September 30 it had $7.2 million in cash and cash equivalents and no long-term debt.</p>
